OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AYoung people should have legal
OL,4,Aguarantee of job or training, Milburn
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn an interview to be broadcast on
OL,8,FSunday, Milburn called for a radical
OL,9,Fshift in government spending away from
OL,10,Fbenefits for young people to measures
OL,11,Fthat support them into work.
OL,13,FHe claims the government spends 25
OL,14,Ftimes as much on benefits for young
OL,15,Fpeople than it spends on supporting
OL,16,Fthem into employment, and believes the
OL,17,Fratio should shift to two to one.
